mermaid-glyph is derived from the ASCII rendering engine of beautiful-mermaid,
which in turn ports that engine from mermaid-ascii. Both are MIT licensed.

The public API, terminal column measurement, width budgeting, overflow
strategies and structured output are original to mermaid-glyph. The grid
layout, edge routing and character drawing are derived from the projects
below.

